\title{00 · Charter — revision 1}
\taxon{Chapter}
\meta{origin}{design/00-charter.md}
\meta{layer}{human}
\tag{chapter}

\p{The goal is a Lean 4 library in which augmented virtual double ∞-categories provide a common ambient language for ordinary, enriched, internal, and ∞-categorical theory. Definitions, comparison theorems, and an implementation-independent interface are the product. The exact ∞-root remains provisional until the foundation gates in \code{11-foundation-feasibility.md} pass. Revision history and supersession are recorded in \code{12-revision-notes.md}; the original documents are preserved verbatim in \code{history/v0/}.}
